      "widgets_values": [
        "A striking editorial close-up portrait of a stylish young adult woman with a sharp jet-black bob haircut, asymmetrical bangs, and porcelain skin with natural fine texture. She wears oversized translucent amber-orange futuristic visor glasses with thin brushed titanium edges, reflecting intricate cyan geometric light patterns. Her expression is confident and slightly mysterious, looking directly into the camera, with softly parted lips and subtle coral makeup.\n\nShe wears a structured glossy electric-blue jacket with a high sculptural collar, black technical seams, and small metallic fasteners. The material combines polished synthetic fabric with realistic reflections and fine stitching details.\n\nBehind her is a dramatic retro-futuristic environment made of large floating geometric panels, illuminated cyan lines, deep black surfaces, and a few vivid orange light accents. The background has strong visual depth, with the geometric elements arranged asymmetrically and slightly out of focus.\n\nCinematic studio lighting: a strong warm orange key light from the left, cool cyan rim lighting from the right, soft realistic shadows, and controlled reflections across the visor, hair, and jacket. Highly detailed facial features, realistic eyes visible through the visor, natural skin pores, physically accurate reflections, premium fashion photography, sharp focus on the face, shallow depth of field, high dynamic range.\n\nHorizontal 16:9 composition designed for a YouTube thumbnail. Position the subject on the right half of the frame, with her face large and clearly visible. Leave the left third of the image relatively dark and uncluttered for adding a title later. No text, no logos, no watermarks, no additional people.",
        4608,
        3456
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "A striking editorial close-up portrait of a stylish young adult woman with a sharp jet-black bob haircut, asymmetrical bangs, and porcelain skin with natural fine texture. She wears oversized translucent amber-orange futuristic visor glasses with thin brushed titanium edges, reflecting intricate cyan geometric light patterns. Her expression is confident and slightly mysterious, looking directly into the camera, with softly parted lips and subtle coral makeup.\n\nShe wears a structured glossy electric-blue jacket with a high sculptural collar, black technical seams, and small metallic fasteners. The material combines polished synthetic fabric with realistic reflections and fine stitching details.\n\nBehind her is a dramatic retro-futuristic environment made of large floating geometric panels, illuminated cyan lines, deep black surfaces, and a few vivid orange light accents. The background has strong visual depth, with the geometric elements arranged asymmetrically and slightly out of focus.\n\nCinematic studio lighting: a strong warm orange key light from the left, cool cyan rim lighting from the right, soft realistic shadows, and controlled reflections across the visor, hair, and jacket. Highly detailed facial features, realistic eyes visible through the visor, natural skin pores, physically accurate reflections, premium fashion photography, sharp focus on the face, shallow depth of field, high dynamic range.\n\nHorizontal 16:9 composition designed for a YouTube thumbnail. Position the subject on the right half of the frame, with her face large and clearly visible. Leave the left third of the image relatively dark and uncluttered for adding a title later. No text, no logos, no watermarks, no additional people.",
